  Link: https://lore.kernel.org/20260708083308.747930-1-hui.zhu@linux.dev
[ziy@nvidia.com: build fix]
  Link: https://lore.kernel.org/DJSGLP9VFLRI.355AAWR2VHIEL@nvidia.com
