 - ``PAGE_IS_FILE`` - Page is file backed
 - ``PAGE_IS_PRESENT`` - Page is present in the memory
 - ``PAGE_IS_SWAPPED`` - Page is in swapped
@@ -252,6 +256,9 @@ Following flags about pages are currently supported:
