    [INFO] detected hugetlb page size: 16777216 KiB
    [INFO] detected hugetlb page size: 16384 KiB
   ok 1 MADV_DONTNEED and MADV_REMOVE on hugetlb
   Totals: pass:1 fail:0 xfail:0 xpass:0 skip:0 error:0
   [PASS]

